  "idea": "Jellyfin: self-host your own private media streaming server for free",
  "text": "The private media server that gives you complete control over your video files. Storing internal training footage on public video platforms risks accidental leaks and privacy breaches. Third-party hosts change terms of service, throttle bandwidth, and can terminate accounts without warning. Jellyfin keeps your entire video catalog self-hosted on private storage behind your own authentication rules. You protect sensitive company assets while streaming anywhere.",
